# $crate_package_name

UniFFI-generated Python bindings for `auki-manifests`.

The generated package exposes JSON-string adapters for the SDK's canonical log manifest builders:

```python
import json
import $binding_module_name

manifest = json.loads($binding_module_name.build_detection_log_manifest_json(
    "boosterapp",
    "session-1",
    "aukilabs/qr/v1",
    "detectorhash",
    "input-log",
    "K1/head",
    "sensorhash",
    "K1/utc",
    "clockhash",
    1_000_000_000,
    30_000_000_000,
))
```

The Rust crate keeps the source-compatible `serde_json::Value` builder API; generated languages receive JCS-canonical JSON strings.
